SOAPBOX: This was my 1st digital contest that I operated fully. Conditions were fair at best, hardly any DX.
SOAPBOX: I enjoyed the challenge of running two radios on two bands simultaneously (two transmitter class, one op - me), it got very exciting at times! I mostly worked FT-4 on 20m and 17m FT8 in the day and after dark I worked 20m FT-8 and 40m FT-8.
SOAPBOX: I sure wish more OP's used FT-4, I would have a lot more Q's. 20m FT-4 was the best all day!
